cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use xHoly, please cite it as below."
title: "xHoly: A Hybrid Rust/Scala Emulator Architecture for Xbox Series S|X and Xbox One"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Baumgardner
    given-names: baummarder
repository-code: "https://github.com/baummarder/xHoly"
url: "https://github.com/baummarder/xHoly"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - emulator
  - xbox
  - rust
  - scala
  - research
abstract: >-
  xHoly is a research emulator/simulator architecture targeting Xbox Series
  S|X and Xbox One game images, built on a hybrid Rust + Scala stack with a
  GPU translation layer, hybrid TOML configuration, and a JVM/Scala.js game
  runtime bridge.
